{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JYs7GhtPV81793026062.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報，美國AI人工智能企業Anthropic正式提交上市申請。</p><p></p><p>Anthropic正式提交在美國納斯達克市場上市申請，股票代碼ANT。</p><p></p><p>招股書顯示，淨虧損由2025年上半年130億美元，2026年上半年擴大至807億美元，主要由於可換股債券公允值上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:08.293194+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T22:38:16.370439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:13.942137+00:00","content_hash":"dd2eebf483fa68207e60ca52d43fc3326c92716e7b9d755aabcf2bfd0cc061f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}